# THE TITLE SCREEN - a course nobody plays (SPEC.md 128.23): after the owner's
# sketch (docs/plans/bounce-bonanza/title-sketch.png), its perspective made
# isometric. The window never moves (`view`); the lettering and the key hints
# are ART painted over the picture (title.bba); label 0 is the slot's digit.
# PROVISIONAL: the owner's to refine (128.23.5).
#
# Screen directions: +x is right-down, +y left-down, -x up-left, -y up-right.
#  UR  the upper right platform, 4 units up: the brown tube's exit and the
#      hidden tube's on its back row, the windmill's doorway on its -x edge
#  the PILLAR, the windmill's house, between UR and LS; the RAIL behind UR
#  LS  the strip under the lettering, half a unit up: the brown tube's ENTRY
#  LL  the lower left platform, 1.5 units up, running off the glass to the
#      left: spring 1 at its front, aimed over the PIT at LC
#  LC  the lower centre, the front floor, running off the bottom; spring 2 in
#      front of UR's cliff, its power set to land a ball on UR
#  the RAMP from UR's +x edge down to the floor; LR, the row BEHIND it, holds
#      the HIDDEN tube's mouth (a ball rolling there is behind the ramp)
course TITLE "Bounce Bonanza"
width 128
origin 512
ball rubber
title
view 56 124 drop 128

# LC, and the channel in front of UR's cliff; the pit beside LL
floor rect 12 12 17 17 flat 2
floor rect 14 9 18 12 flat 2
hole rect 12 15 14 17
# the pillar, its back, and the rail behind UR and LR
wall rect 12 7 14 12 flat 9.5
wall rect 12 6 14 7 flat 9
wall rect 12 5 25 6 flat 9
# UR
floor rect 14 6 18 9 flat 6
# the ramp, LR behind it, its foot and the floor in front of it
floor rect 18 7 20 9 ramp x 18 20 6 2
floor rect 18 6 20 7 flat 2
floor rect 20 6 21 11 flat 2
floor rect 18 9 20 11 flat 2
# LR, running off the glass to the right and the bottom
floor rect 21 6 24 11 flat 2
floor rect 17 11 24 17 flat 2
# LR's rails, off the glass: the east one holds the hidden tube
wall rect 24 6 25 18 flat 3
wall rect 12 17 24 18 flat 3
# LS and its back wall
floor rect 9 12 12 13 flat 2.5
wall rect 9 11 12 12 flat 3.5
# LL
floor rect 7 14 12 17 flat 3.5

# the brown tube, LS to UR, through the back wall, the pillar and the rail
tube keep 10 12 16 6 via 10 11 via 12 11 via 12 5 via 16 5
# the windmill, UR through the pillar onto LS's end of LC
prop windmill 14 8
tube keep 14 8 13 12 via 13 8 out -x
# the HIDDEN tube, off the glass: LR's east rail up and along the back rail to UR's back row
tube keep 23 13 17 6 via 24 13 via 24 5 via 17 5 out +y
spring 10 15 512
spring 15 9 768

art title.bba 4 4
start 15 13
